# Inside the Belly (otherAreas 26): Selbina's Zaldon (a script: A Boy's Dream's trade; default 150).
# FISHING_ENABLE (P6): `setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true` in the header; every section reads xi.settings.map.FISHING_ENABLE == true
# (false in settings/default/map.lua).
# Under the Sea, The Sand Charm and The Real Gift completed; fishing skill 30 (300 stored); a level 30 Warrior with a
# Chocobo Feather, a Fat Greedie, three Zafmlug Bass and a Silver Shark. Available (section 1 holds): a bass traded: no
# trade handler: nothing, kept. Zaldon 161 (Progress); finished: begun. Accepted, total skill 30 (< 40): 162 (the four
# tier-1 fish). Trades: a bass and the feather: nil (not exactly one fish); a Fat Greedie (no fishRewards entry):
# nil; two bass: nil; one bass: the trade confirmed at once (the bass gone), randomInt(1, 1000) <= 14: 166 (0, the Blue Rock), else 167. A GM completes the quest before the finish: the
# accepted section's 166 / 167 finish (giveReward, complete, fame +10 San d'Oria and Bastok) is the #accepted flow's,
# so the finish played is the completed section's: the rock on a 166, 15 gil, the local vars cleared. Completed: 162 again; the Silver Shark: 166 (0, the Trident) on a roll <= 14, else 167; finished: the trident
# on a 166, 250 gil, the title Ace Angler; no fame. The feather traded while completed: nil (no fishRewards entry).
# The lookup runs every onEventFinish entry whose check holds when its turn comes (interaction_lookup.lua
# runHandlersInData: the check is evaluated per entry, after the entries before it ran). The accepted section's 166 /
# 167 finish completes the quest, so the completed section's check then holds too and its 166 / 167 runs: giveReward
# reads the fishId local var the first one cleared (0), and `reward.gil` on fishRewards[0] (nil) raises
# (Inside_the_Belly.lua:546: attempt to index local 'reward'). The #accepted flow records that finish.
lists Selbina/Zaldon/onTrigger Selbina/Zaldon/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/161 Selbina/onEventFinish/166 Selbina/onEventFinish/167
char zone=Selbina pos=-10.3,-7.287,-6.742 job=WAR lvl=30
setting map.FISHING_ENABLE true
quest OtherAreas.UnderTheSea completed
quest OtherAreas.TheSandCharm completed
quest OtherAreas.TheRealGift completed
skill Fishing 300
item ChocoboFeather
item FatGreedie
item ZafmlugBass x3
item SilverShark
login
trade Zaldon ZafmlugBass x1             # available: no trade handler: nothing; kept
trigger Zaldon                          # available, skill 30: 161
finish                                  # begun
trigger Zaldon                          # accepted, skill 30 < 40: 162 (the tier-1 list)
finish
trade Zaldon ZafmlugBass x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # not exactly the fish: nil
trade Zaldon FatGreedie x1              # no entry: nil
trade Zaldon ZafmlugBass x2             # two: nil
trade Zaldon ZafmlugBass x1             # confirmed now; roll <= 14: 166 (0, Blue Rock), else 167
quest OtherAreas.InsideTheBelly completed # a GM: the accepted finish is the #accepted flow's
finish                                  # the completed section's: the rock on a 166; 15 gil; no fame
trigger Zaldon                          # completed: 162
finish
trade Zaldon SilverShark x1             # roll <= 14: 166 (0, Trident), else 167
finish                                  # the trident on a 166; 250 gil; Ace Angler; no fame
trade Zaldon ChocoboFeather x1          # completed: no entry: nil; kept
